</figure>
<figure id="A5.T7.fig1" class="ltx_table ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:464.3pt;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A5.T7.fig1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 7</span>: </span><span id="A5.T7.fig1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Full finetuning on classification with ViT-B/8 DINO and OpenLLaMA-3B<span id="A5.T7.fig1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. We compare our proposed approach with the image-only baseline when fine-tuning on the target dataset. All vision encoders are initialized from DINO weights, and our approach leverages unpaired text data using OpenLLaMA-3B embeddings.</span></span></figcaption>
<div id="A5.T7.fig1.6" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:464.3pt;height:34.8pt;vertical-align:-16.0pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-178.9pt,13.4pt) scale(0.564688014829407,0.564688014829407) ;">
<table id="A5.T7.fig1.6.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
