<figure id="A5.T14.fig1" class="ltx_table ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:464.3pt;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A5.T14.fig1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 14</span>: </span><span id="A5.T14.fig1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Full linear probing on classification with ViT-L/14 DINOv2 and OpenLLaMA-3B<span id="A5.T14.fig1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. We compare our proposed approach with the image-only baseline when training a linear probe on the target dataset. All vision encoders are initialized from DINOv2 weights, and our approach leverages unpaired text data using OpenLLaMA-3B embeddings.</span></span></figcaption>
