<figure id="A5.T19" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A5.T19.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 19</span>: </span><span id="A5.T19.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Linear evaluation of frozen features on 10 fine-grained benchmarks for few-shot learning with DINOv2 ViT-L/14.<span id="A5.T19.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> We compare our proposed approach with the image-only baseline by training a linear classifier on top of frozen VIT-L/14 DINOv2 features. Our method leverages unpaired text data using OpenLLaMA-3B</span></span></figcaption>
