<figure id="A5.T28" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A5.T28.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 28</span>: </span><span id="A5.T28.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Full finetuning of the vision encoder and linear head with different text-to-image batch ratios <math id="A5.T28.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math> on SUN397. Results show that performance is largely insensitive to <math id="A5.T28.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></figcaption>
